Modifications (2026-11-08):

  * Renamed the packages to dsh-memory-plus and
    dsh-memory-consolidation-plus and made them independently installable
    (esbuild build; no deepseek-harness source checkout required).
  * Added the memory_search and memory_read model tools
    (packages/memory/src/search.ts, src/search-core.ts).
  * Added turn-end extraction cost gates
    (packages/memory-consolidation/src/extract-gates.ts) and the
    extractMinIntervalMinutes / extractMinSurfaceEvents / extractMaxPerHour
    configuration keys.
  * Added unit tests for the search core, the gates, and the tool
    registration contract.

